{"ID":"20240513083025-ojvb8il","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083025-ojvb8il","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083025-ojvb8il\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513171512-rrjzh30\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513171512-rrjzh30\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513171512-rrjzh30\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:497,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:497\u0026#125;","title":"285","type":"doc","updated":"20240514173808"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513171512-rrjzh30","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 957px;","id":"20240513171512-rrjzh30","updated":"20240514173808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"217-2 L, HH"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1964(44) / 普通"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/05/16"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：\n1.)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左乳硬塊仍有(左乳近胸口位)，如指甲大、表面光滑。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n1.)睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2.)大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.)小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4.)胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5.)口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6.)身："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上身無熱，額頭尚有一點熱("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"仍有一點浮陽"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7.)手足："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足涼"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8.)體力："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寸脈大於尺("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"陽脈大於陰脈是好的，代表陽氣已回"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")，左脈稍大於右脈("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"女子左血右氣，所以左脈大於右脈是正常的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃紅(兩側有一點牙痕)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"進步中"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1.) "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同5月14 號方("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"補血、涼血，通乳、補腰腎、軟堅消否，通利三焦、疏泄肝經，去熱、潤肺，健脾、去溼"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再3付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9碗煮3碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三餐飯前服  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2.)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" HT-2 漢唐2號還有(繼續服用)(退乳丸，協助清除乳房硬塊)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.)繼續以HT-2 強心陽，助消導奶水。而血稍不足，以四物湯補之(有熱改用生地)。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"欲令血足奶充，並欲藉排經時，重用牡蠣以軟堅消否、清除陳鈣。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而乳頭往裡絡肝經，故需通利三焦、疏泄肝經，助清除乳房周圍之經絡淤積。而舌黃有燥故需去熱，潤肺。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"兼佐以健脾去溼，以助運化健胃氣。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}